EEXXAAMMPPLLEE
       cchhmmeemm ----eennaabbllee 11002244
           This command requests 1024 MiB of memory to be set online.

       cchhmmeemm --ee 22gg
           This command requests 2 GiB of memory to be set online.

       cchhmmeemm ----ddiissaabbllee 00xx0000000000000000ee44000000000000--00xx0000000000000000ff33ffffffffffff
           This command requests the memory range starting with
           0x00000000e4000000 and ending with 0x00000000f3ffffff to be set
           offline.

       cchhmmeemm --bb --dd 1100
           This command requests the memory block number 10 to be set offline.

